## 📦 Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/ziyandadyani/check-in-hub.git
cd geo-clock-in
```

---

### 2. Setup Frontend

```bash
cd client
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

### 3. Setup Backend

```bash
cd server
npm install
npm run dev
```

---

## 🔗 API Endpoints

### Clock-In

```http
POST /api/clock-ins
```

### Get All Clock-Ins

```http
GET /api/clock-ins
```

---

## 🌐 Deployment

The app is deployed using **Render**:

* Frontend → Static Site
* Backend → Web Service

---

## ⚠️ Known Limitations

* Free-tier backend  ( on Render deployment service) may experience cold starts
* Geolocation accuracy depends on user device/browser

